{'symbol': 'MGM', 'date': '2023-02-21 06:30:00', 'title': "MGM RESORTS BECOMES FIRST GAMING COMPANY TO SIGN UNITED NATIONS' CEO WATER MANDATE", 'text': 'MGM RESORTS CEO: HISTORIC WESTERN DROUGHT CRISIS, EFFECTS OF CLIMATE CHANGE ARE MAKING BOLD COMMITMENTS MORE CRITICAL THAN EVER LAS VEGAS , FEB. 21, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL (NYSE: MGM) ("MGM RESORTS" OR THE "COMPANY") TODAY ANNOUNCED IT ENDORSED THE UNITED NATIONS\' CEO WATER MANDATE\xa0– A GLOBAL INITIATIVE AND COALITION OF HUNDREDS OF MAJOR COMPANIES MAKING BOLD COMMITMENTS TO ADDRESS WATER CRISES AND CHALLENGES. MGM RESORTS IS THE FIRST GAMING COMPANY TO ENDORSE THE MANDATE.'}